~ start

Aunt Stephanie: Family doesn't pay. Say the word and I'll get the ship moving on your cousin.
- Check on Todd for me.
	do story.set_flag("todd_mission_offered")
	do missions.start_mission(station.canned_mission())
	Aunt Stephanie: Good. Fly out and find him.
	=> END
- Not right now.
	=> END

~ status_check
if story.has_flag("todd_mission_offered")
	Aunt Stephanie: You still owe me a visit to Todd's place.
else
	Aunt Stephanie: Everything's quiet around here.
=> END
